{24 = 24-34}
104=24.	But the king, endowed with power by @wDN{Enlil}, 
108=25.	chosen by @wDN{Inana} with her @vart[t216.v1,t216.v1]{@varn{1 ms. adds:} holy } heart -- @wRN{@wDN{Utu}-ḫeŋal}, the mighty man, 
